    "title": "The Epicurean Paradox",
    "caption": "If God is all-powerful, all-knowing, and all-good, why does evil exist? Let's explore the Epicurean Paradox and what this argument really means.\n\n#EpicureanParadox #ProblemOfEvil #Christianity #Faith #Bible",
