  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "panel": 0,
      "narration": "I'm sure y'all have seen this graph before. And if you haven't, according to this graph, the God of the Bible shouldn't even exist. Sounds crazy, right? But look at the argument.",
